      "message": "fix(post): lift Z before the G30 at every Tormach tool change\n\nA bare G30 can move X, Y and Z together. Between tools PathPilot's own\nConversational programs lift Z first, then G30; the post now writes\nG53 G0 Z0 (top of Z travel, machine coordinates) before the G30 that\nprecedes every T.. M6, the same Z-first order its program end uses.\n\nThe old \"G30 before M6\" check ran only over golden streams with no tool\nchange, so it never fired; a two-tool test now pins the sequence.\n\nRefs #131\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
