      "message": "fix(post): 770MX Z feed from the operator's manual; cite it as the post's source\n\nTormach's \"UM10587: 770MX Operator's Manual\" (0626A) §2.2 gives the\nZ-axis maximum feed as 250 IPM; the machine file had the 230 IPM figure\nfrom a web spec page. The post's provenance header now names the\nmanual's chapter 10 (G-code, canned cycles, M-codes) and its G30\nsections, which confirm the dialect it writes: dwell P in seconds,\nG91.1 as the default arc mode, G64 P~ Q~, G84 with an optional P, a G30\nbefore tool changes, and Txx M06 for the ATC. No output changes.\n\nRefs #131\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
